<h1>Privacy policy</h1><p class="caption">Updated 16 November 2026</p>
<p>Stocklumo is operated by Omar Hussain Fahmi. Privacy questions or requests: <a href="mailto:omarhussainfahmi@hotmail.com">omarhussainfahmi@hotmail.com</a> or <a href="tel:+966500411051">+966 50 041 1051</a>.</p>
<h2 id="browser-data">What stays in your browser</h2>
<p>Your watchlist, recently viewed symbols, saved screener preset, practice holdings and theme use local storage. There is no Stocklumo account or automatic device sync. Records remain until changed, cleared or removed by your browser. Private browsing or blocked storage can prevent saving. Different browsers, devices and site addresses have separate records.</p>
<p>The analytics choice also uses local storage and expires after 180 days. The background-motion preference uses session storage for this browser session. If storage is blocked, motion choices apply only to the current page. Stock-detail session charts hold observations from this visit in memory; they are not a saved price-history archive. Unsaved portfolio edits are not automatically saved.</p>
<h2 id="backups">Downloads and restores</h2>
<p><a href="/settings">Privacy &amp; backups</a> downloads your watchlist, recent symbols, practice holdings, screener preset and theme as JSON. Export and restore run in your browser; no backup is uploaded or kept on Stocklumo's server. The file is not encrypted by Stocklumo and can contain quantities, purchase prices and dates. Keep it private, including copies made by your device or cloud-storage service.</p>
<p>Restore validates files up to 128 KB and replaces the categories included in the file. Empty categories can clear current records; records are not merged. Analytics consent, motion preferences, live quotes, unsaved edits and session-chart observations are excluded. Back up current data before restoring.</p>
<h2 id="site-requests">Requests needed to run the site</h2>
<p>Your browser sends symbols, searches, selected dates and ordinary connection information to Stocklumo for quotes, charts, news, company information and research tools. The server requests market data from Finnhub; its API key stays server-side. Portfolio quantities, purchase prices and purchase dates remain in your browser; valuation requests use symbols, not those private entries.</p>
<p>Company logos are bundled or fetched and cached by Stocklumo's server from Finnhub's image CDN. Your browser does not contact that CDN directly. Missing images use a ticker badge. Hero videos, posters and effects are served as site assets; decorative imagery is not a live market-data feed.</p>
<p>Render hosts the site and processes network information such as IP addresses and requested URLs to deliver and protect it. Hosting and data-provider logs follow their own retention policies; Stocklumo does not promise a separate deletion schedule for those logs.</p>
<h2 id="analytics">Cookies, storage and optional analytics</h2>
<p>Stocklumo does not set advertising or tracking cookies. Local and session storage support the features above. Hosting services may use security technologies. Cookie settings controls optional analytics; it does not clear saved lists or holdings.</p>
<p>When configured on the production site, Cloudflare Web Analytics loads only after you allow it. It measures page visits, browser/device information and page performance. Cloudflare describes the service as cookie-free and without cross-site visitor tracking. See <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare's analytics documentation</a>. Local previews do not load its beacon.</p>
<p>Rejecting keeps all features available. Closing the notice without choosing leaves analytics off unless previously allowed. We honor Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control. Your choice lasts 180 days; clearing storage can make the notice appear again. If storage is blocked, the choice applies only to this visit.</p>
<p>Change your choice through Cookie settings in the footer or <a href="/settings">Privacy &amp; backups</a>. Rejecting after the beacon loaded reloads the page to stop it. Withdrawal does not undo measurements already received; Stocklumo does not keep an individual analytics profile from which to remove them.</p>
<h2 id="providers">External services and contact links</h2>
<p>Finnhub supplies market information, Render hosts the site, Cloudflare supplies optional analytics, and Sentry can receive the limited operational reports below. Providers may process information outside your country under their own policies. See <a href="https://render.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Render privacy</a>, <a href="https://finnhub.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Finnhub provider information</a> and <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare privacy</a>.</p>
<p>News and company links lead to their publishers. LinkedIn, Instagram and WhatsApp links open those services; they are links, not embedded social trackers. Their privacy practices apply when you visit or contact us there. Email and telephone links use your chosen apps or providers. Messages can include your address, phone number and contents. Avoid sending passwords, API keys, backup files or sensitive financial records.</p>
<h2 id="monitoring">Server error monitoring</h2>
<p>Provider-failure diagnostics record a fixed operation label and exception type. These entries omit exception messages, request URLs, API keys and response bodies.</p>
<p>When enabled by the operator, Sentry receives exception type, environment, software version and event time. Stocklumo omits exception messages, stack traces, request URLs, headers, bodies, user profiles, breadcrumbs and browser-held portfolio data. Tracing, session replay and log streaming are not enabled. Retention and processing depend on the configured account and <a href="https://sentry.io/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sentry's privacy policy</a>. This operational monitoring is separate from optional analytics.</p>
<h2 id="your-choices">Your choices</h2>
<p>Remove individual entries through the relevant feature, or clear local records and preferences using your browser's site-data controls. Export first if needed. Delete downloaded backups separately. Pausing background motion does not stop market updates.</p>
<p>We do not sell personal information or run advertising profiles. Contact us for access, correction, deletion or other requests about information you sent us. We cannot recover browser-only records or deleted backups. Rights and complaint options depend on your location, including contacting your local data-protection authority where applicable.</p>
